flowchart LR
  subgraph public[Public synthetic research surface]
    fixture[Seeded synthetic fixture] --> split[Stratified holdout]
    split --> baseline[Prevalence baseline]
    split --> challenger[Calibrated Extra Trees]
    baseline --> evidence[Versioned evaluation evidence]
    challenger --> evidence
    evidence --> api[Flask health, timeline, and score API]
    api --> dashboard[Accessible threshold and timeline dashboard]
    dashboard --> release[GitHub Actions image release]
    release --> azure[Azure Container Apps, scale to zero]
  end

  subgraph local[Local restricted research boundary]
    mimic[Owner-obtained MIMIC files] --> features[Availability-time feature pipeline]
    features --> patient_split[Patient-level split]
    patient_split --> artifacts[Ignored local models and research artifacts]
  end

  artifacts -. excluded from public repository and image .-> release
